{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917030/extras/244e30d9d8538330c77cb78e45a3c6df.avif?t=1774442870\" width=1200 height=603 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the most atmospheric bar in the galaxy - <i>Prometheus-9</i>, hidden among the forgotten stars of a distant sector.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the bartender and owner of this cosmic hideout, where the fates of drifters, bounty hunters, lovers, fugitives, and mysterious alien beings intertwine \u2014 some so rare, even Central Command has never heard of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917030/extras/2d763ae22c1daf63e309d4fdcf44bc81.avif?t=1774442870\" width=1200 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft custom cocktails by mixing exotic ingredients from across the galaxy, and see how each drink affects your guests\u2019 moods, honesty, and even life decisions. After all, every visitor comes not just for a drink, but with a story to tell \u2014 and a problem that maybe, just maybe, you can help solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917030/extras/20d06b26301177cbe7de1abe2adf5175.poster.avif?t=1774442870\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917030/extras/20d06b26301177cbe7de1abe2adf5175.webm?t=1774442870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917030/extras/20d06b26301177cbe7de1abe2adf5175.mp4?t=1774442870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in deep conversations where every choice can alter the course of events. Build relationships with key characters \u2014 including women from different worlds and species \u2014 and see them evolve from casual flirting to meaningful romances where emotions outweigh the distance between stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917030/extras/358686a3b92b9591c45f2fb0aa765d04.avif?t=1774442870\" width=1200 height=550 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your bar, unlock new recipes, decorate your space with unique items, and grow <i>Prometheus-9</i> into a sanctuary for the galaxy\u2019s most unusual and unforgettable souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917030/extras/2d763ae22c1daf63e309d4fdcf44bc81.avif?t=1774442870\" width=1200 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 An atmospheric visual novel set in the far reaches of space<br> \u2764\ufe0f 6 unique ladies from across the galaxy to bond and build relationships with<br> \u2728 4 side characters you can get <i>very</i> close to<br> \u2764\ufe0f A unique cocktail-making mechanic using exotic ingredients<br> \u2728 Non-linear storylines with multiple paths and outcomes<br> \u2764\ufe0f Bar development and customization \u2014 buy new ingredients and decorate your interior</p>","background":"https: